ions with native MCP support, multi-tenant isolation, semantic search, and dashboard UI for memory inspection.\",\n         \"release_date\": \"2026-04-28\",\n         \"category\": \"project memory agent\",\n         \"sources\": [\"Hacker News\"],\n         \"community_quotes\": [\n           \"Open-source shared memory for AI agent teams\",\n           \"Memories persist and are searchable across sessions\",\n           \"Agents inherit accumulated team knowledge from day one\",\n           \"Native MCP support with multi-tenant isolation\"\n         ]\n       }\n     ]\n     ```\n\n   - **`/home/runner/work/agentdaily/agentdaily/updates/2026-04-29/data.json`**\n     - **Why important**: Directory check revealed existing data files in the workspace\n     - **Action**: Read to check contents (112 bytes)\n\n   - **TODO list tracking**\n     - Created 27-item TODO list to track progress through all research questions\n     - Current status: Items 1-3 completed, item 4 in progress\n\n4. **Errors and Fixes**:\n   \n   - **Web Search Rate Limiting (MCP error -429)**:\n     - **Error**: \"Rate limit reached for requests\" on web_search_prime tool\n     - **Impact**: Unable to perform web searches for most queries\n     - **Fix**: Switched from WebSearch tool to webReader tool to directly fetch content from known URLs (Product Hunt, GitHub, Hacker News)\n     - **Frequency**: Occurred on approximately 10+ search attempts\n   \n   - **Forbidden Access Error (MCP error -400)**:\n     - **Error**: \"Access to the requested URL is forbidden\" when trying to access analytics-skills GitHub repo\n     - **Impact**: Could not fetch details on that specific product\n     - **Fix**: Skipped that URL and continued with other sources\n   \n   - **File Write Error**:\n     - **Error**: \"File has not been read yet. Read it first before writing to it.\"\n     - **Impact**: Initial attempt to write to new-product.json failed\n     - **Fix**: Read the file first, then performed the writ